docs {
  # GET /author-information/{id}
  
  Retrieves public instructor profile fields and published course IDs.
  
  ## HTTP Method & Route
  - **Method:** `GET`
  - **Route:** `/wp-json/tutor/v1/author-information/:id`
  
  ## Authentication
  - **Public** when the user's public profile layout is not private.
  - Bearer optional. Private fields (`user_login`, `user_email`, `user_registered`, `user_url`) only when the caller may view private user fields.
  
  ## Path Parameters
  
  | Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
  | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
  | `id` | `integer` | **Yes** | Instructor user ID. |
  
  ## Responses
  
  ### 200 OK (public fields)
  ```json
  {
    "code": "tutor_read_author",
    "message": "Author details retrieved successfully",
    "data": {
      "ID": 1,
      "display_name": "Jane Doe",
      "user_nicename": "jane_instructor",
      "courses": [105, 110, 120]
    }
  }
  ```
  
  ### 404 Not Found
  ```json
  {
    "code": "tutor_read_author",
    "message": "Author not found",
    "data": []
  }
  ```
}
